"></iframe></p><p>To provide you more detailed instruction, you can also cl=
ick ASUS YouTube video link below to know more about How to update BIOS wit=
h ASUS Firmware Update/EZ Flash:</p><p><a href=3D"https://www.youtube.com/w=
atch?v=3DeR19bBJU-DA" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">https:/=
/www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DeR19bBJU-DA</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please follow=
