 support site</a> with your device's model name, here you can learn more ab=
out <a href=3D"https://www.asus.com/support/FAQ/1035376/" target=3D"_blank"=
 rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">How to search and download BIOS</a>.&nbsp;<br>=
<strong>Note</strong>: To download the corresponding BIOS file, please refe=
r to <a href=3D"https://www.asus.com/support/faq/1030673" target=3D"_blank"=
 rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">How to check the model name</a>.</li><li>In th=
e support page, please search for <strong>[BIOS for ASUS EZ Flash Utility]<=
/strong> or&nbsp;<strong>[BIOS version]</strong>&nbsp;file which is located=
 in the <strong>BIOS category</strong><span style=3D"color:#FF0000;"><span>=
=E2=91=A0</span></span>, and then click <strong>[Download]</strong><span st=
yle=3D"color:#FF0000;"><span>=E2=91=A1</span></span>&nbsp;<br><img class=3D=
"image_resized" style=3D"height:291px;width:600px;" src=3D"https://kmpic.as=
us.com/images/2022/09/19/38476be7-4cef-4587-88bd-2e1e0f7a0f11.png" alt=3D""=
></li></ol><p>&nbsp;</p></details><details open=3D""><summary><a id=3D"B2">=
<span style=3D"color:#0000FF;"><span><strong>Step 2. Save BIOS file to port=
able storage device and start updating</strong></span></span></a></summary>=
<p>Before starting to use ASUS Firmware Update/EZ Flash to update BIOS, ple=
ase extract the downloaded BIOS file, and then copy the extracted file to a=
 portable storage device (USB flash drive or external hard drive).</p><p><s=
trong>Note</strong>: The USB flash drive <span style=3D"color:#FF0000;"><sp=
an><strong>format must be FAT32</strong></span></span> so that you are able=
 to update BIOS in the BIOS utility.&nbsp;Here you can learn more about <a =
href=3D"https://www.asus.com/support/FAQ/1044735/" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D=
"noopener noreferrer">How to convert the USB flash drive format to FAT32</a=
>.</p><ol><li>After downloading the BIOS file, right-click <strong>the file=
</strong><span style=3D"color:#FF0000;"><span>=E2=91=A0 </span></span>and t=
hen select <strong>[Extract All]</strong><span style=3D"color:#FF0000;"><sp=
