he extraction is completed, please go to the folder and connect the portabl=
e storage device to your ASUS device. Right-click the&nbsp;<strong>BIOS fil=
e</strong><span style=3D"color:#FF0000;"><span>=E2=91=A4</span></span>, the=
n select <strong>[Show more options]</strong><span style=3D"color:#FF0000;"=
><span>=E2=91=A5</span></span>.&nbsp;<br><img class=3D"image_resized" style=
=3D"height:376px;width:600px;" src=3D"https://kmpic.asus.com/images/2022/09=
