;<strong>[Send to]</strong><span style=3D"color:#FF0000;"><span>=E2=91=A6</=
span></span>, then select&nbsp;<strong>[Your portable device]</strong><span=
 style=3D"color:#FF0000;"><span>=E2=91=A7</span></span>.&nbsp;<br><img clas=
s=3D"image_resized" style=3D"height:376px;width:600px;" src=3D"https://kmpi=
c.asus.com/images/2022/09/19/d151834e-0b53-4064-9730-d0cd311a2cd8.png" alt=
=3D""></li><li>The preparation is finished, please access the BIOS setup sc=
reen on the device.&nbsp;<br>When the device is not powered on, <strong>pre=
ss and hold the [F2] key on the keyboard</strong>, then press the <strong>p=
ower button</strong> to turn on the device. Keep holding the [F2] key until=
