w Keys and Enter key on the keyboard</strong>, <strong>Touchpad</strong>, o=
r <strong>Mouse</strong>.</p><p><strong>Note</strong>: The BIOS update scre=
en below may vary slightly depending on the model.</p><ol><li>After enterin=
g the BIOS Utility, go to the <strong>Advanced Mode</strong> by pressing <s=
trong>Hotkey[F7]</strong> or use <strong>cursor </strong>to click<span styl=
