<span style=3D"color:#FF0000;"><span>=E2=91=A4</span></span>.&nbsp;<br>The =
BIOS file naming convention for ASUS devices follows the format of <strong>=
'Model'</strong>AS.<strong>'BIOS Version'</strong>, as illustrated by the e=
